  "_comment": "Features dynajs + Node can run. `npm run test262:extract` keeps a test only if EVERY feature it declares appears below (tests with no `features` tag are always extracted). Seeded from test262 features.txt \"Standard language features\", minus features that structurally cannot pass in this single-realm-on-Node harness. This is a starting point: prune entries as you see them FAIL, or add proposals as dynajs gains support. Edit freely; extra keys (starting with _) are ignored by the loader.",
